{"version":1,"content":"<p>10月22日，OpenAI正接近完成一輪最高300億美元的融資，投前估值達到1.25萬億美元。知情人士透露，本輪融資由阿聯酋投資者和投資機構Coatue聯合領投，OpenAI計劃將其作為潛在首次公開募股（IPO）前的過渡性融資。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583464.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T22:59:39.641818+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T22:52:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T22:57:55.887816+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T22:57:55.887816+00:00","content_hash":"d09009cd98d86c420c08cb636fad90f393c95226d61b6c23016b0da0fb8fde74","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}